        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        // 4. CLOSING CONTAINER — 5 required + 3 available + Reserved Omission
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        //
        // Library CLOSING promotes 3 sections from bare-bone reserved:
        //   Cc (cleanup) — libraries with resources need Drop impls
        //   X2 (extension) — libraries with planned growth points
        //   X3 (troubleshooting) — libraries with known issues
        //
        // X6 (template guide) is NOT PRESENT — library is a
        // derived file, not a template. Its presence would mean
        // "I am still a template" which is false.
